// heavy — the SQUARE-vulnerable enemy (#29 matrix: Heavy → Square).
//
// The body IS the tell (#27's 2026-06-09 shape-based-not-colour-only lock): a
// squat, axis-aligned block with a square footprint — the slowest gesture in
// the matrix drawn around the bluntest silhouette. `rot` is deliberately zero
// so the footprint stays square-on to the camera. Colour (amber) only
// reinforces it.
//
// Gray-box art from an existing primitive: distinct modelled bodies per kind
// stay deferred (#26).
Prefab(
    mesh: Some("cube"),
    role: "enemy",
    kind: Some("heavy"),
    rot: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0),
    scale: (0.26, 0.22, 0.26),
    material: Some((diffuse: (200, 150, 60), ambient: (48, 36, 16))),
)
